  "notes": "light: amber, 75\n\n2 Nov 2026 native-pixel draft. New C04 version in asset-c04, replaces yellow-ring tank only after approval. 32×40 art px, scale 1, baseline 39; ten hand-keyed emissive fire frames at 10 FPS (1 second). Static neutral iron body and separate dark iron/coal Guts; no painted light, water, smoke or bloom. Strong bowl/tripod silhouette, raised iron horns and furnace louvres. Existing library versions retained. Gameplay remains the tank until Claude fits hit area and releases with the required GV bump. Renderer-size and flame-loop review pending; not battle-tested or approved.\n\n2 Nov: Claude/Jarred review fix: removed both orange bowl vents from every emissive frame to avoid an accidental robot face. All Body/Guts PNGs, dimensions, baseline, scale, flame pixels, timing and light note remain unchanged. No new release.",
